<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rand Merchant Bank half yr attrib up 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Rand Merchant Bank half yr attrib up 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   60.0    vs   44.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   83.3    vs   61.3</p>
<p>    Tax			 22.5    vs   16.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   60.0    vs   44.5</p>
<p>Net trading and</p>
<p>    interest income	110.2    vs   87.3</p>
<p>Provision for bad</p>
<p>    and doubtful debts    11.1    vs   13.1</p>
<p>    Other income	    65.3    vs   46.4</p>
<p>Full name: Rand Merchant Bank Ltd (financial-insurance)</p>
<p>NOTE - Unlisted Rand Merchant Bank is one of the main operating subsidiaries of Rand Merchant Bank Holdings Ltd .</p>
<p>The company said it was confident that it remained well positioned and given the growth in new business areas it anticipated that it would continue to exceed its targeted growth in earnings for the remainder of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
